WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.334
Understanding South Africa's

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.753
Genocide Case against Israel, Part two

00:00:03.753 --> 00:00:04.713
What is genocide?

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:05.964
The term “genocide” didn't

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:08.091
exist before 1944.

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.592
That is, until this man,

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:11.428
a Jewish lawyer from Poland,

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:12.012
coined the term

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:14.055
to describe Nazi policies

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:15.682
of systematic murder.

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:16.057
At first

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:16.808
this was just a word

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.184
without any legal power.

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.811
Until in 1948, the U.N.

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:21.312
drafted the Genocide Convention,

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:23.481
which makes this an international crime,

00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:24.816
defining genocide as:

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:25.900
“Killing members of a group;”

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.944
“Causing serious bodily harm or mental harm

00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:28.903
to members of a group;”

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:30.113
And crucially,

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:33.033
“Deliberately inflicting on a group conditions of life

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.325
calculated to bring about

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:37.203
its physical destruction in whole or in part;”

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.038
“Deliberately.”

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:38.955
You have to prove that

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:40.957
they set out to do this,

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:42.876
to destroy a group of people.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:43.251
every country

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:43.793
that has signed

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:45.795
has an obligation to prevent

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:48.465
and punish genocide wherever it happens.

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:48.840
And that's why

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.425
South Africa filed this case.

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:51.259
They see that genocide

00:00:51.259 --> 00:00:52.218
is happening in Gaza

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.178
and it is their duty

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:54.512
to call it out In part three,

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:57.223
I will dive into this 84 page document,

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.433
the evidence South Africa

00:00:58.433 --> 00:00:59.726
is using in this case.

